: "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2025-01-06 020032.png", "id": "1804485603644205", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982577_1804485610310871_7351430968151085318_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BfAttlzWEy0Q7kNvwEUwJ2V&_nc_oc=AdrAGfOt2otIbtPCuMty_JMrGqPiHjsMCbxYb9qFwbbeJ9JXV73c2Myxx5Bk3G4uZjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2LhLWIo-MOBf9loep2Rcf94PxvLIQRQ6k0JU8hUAzoLA&oe=69F75BBB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2025-01-06 020310.png", "id": "904463401670359", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974757_904463405003692_6994631317695213938_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PzXBIoovTWQQ7kNvwFHc2JC&_nc_oc=AdoFOgTqlNx4_suYY7dQYDcBnvGtvJfY1eR6cAtyQDUrFcljIRx6nuzI-gDgqvJodNw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af20HPlRy3ncC5fiD-3K_H45yb4gU8d7Zm0I4--AX0PU4g&oe=69F75204"}, "display_name": "Asphalt Fury", "keywords": ["Race", "Reflex", "Fun", "Comfort", "Realistic"], "long_description": "Step into the driver\u2019s seat with Asphalt Fury, the most immersive VR racing game on Meta Quest. Experience the thrill of high-speed chases through neon-lit cityscapes, futuristic highways, and dramatic racing arenas. Designed for adrenaline junkies and racing enthusiasts, Asphalt Fury offers a seamless blend of breathtaking visuals, responsive controls, and strategic gameplay.\n\nCustomize your vehicles with unique upgrades and bold designs to make your mark on the track. Each race is a test of skill and reflexes as you navigate sharp turns, dodge obstacles, and outpace rivals in heart-pounding competitions. Dynamic lighting, fiery trails, and realistic effects make every race feel alive.\n\nCompete to climb the leaderboards, unlock achievements, and challenge your friends in multiplayer mode. Whether you\u2019re mastering solo challenges or engaging in fierce rivalries, Asphalt Fury keeps the action intense and rewarding.\n\nAre you ready to dominate the road and leave a blazing trail behind? Download Asphalt Fury now and fuel your need for speed!", "short_description": "Get ready for the ultimate adrenaline rush with Asphalt Fury, a high-speed racing game designed for Meta Quest. Immerse yourself in intense races, where blazing trails, neon-lit cityscapes, and dynamic challenges keep you on edge. Customize your cars, master sharp turns, and compete in thrilling races to dominate the leaderboard. With stunning visuals and responsive controls, Asphalt Fury offers an unparalleled VR racing experience that combines speed, strategy, and pure excitement."}]}, "developer_name": "Esti Soft", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nRyME7ipZKdK4JPdh6Aza7RPKWnEWmNI/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Esti Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.esti.tr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28178701345111522"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 7, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1546069890008836"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1999274467540715"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "730826563076400"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "62801580694687